About This Project

Crystal Folders is a free and open-source Windows application that allows you to
customize folder icons with ease. The software is provided free of charge and
will remain so forever.

The icon customization functionality relies on Windows desktop.ini mechanism,
which is a standard Windows feature. The software does not collect, store, or
transmit any personal data. No internet connection is required for core
functionality.

While the software has been tested extensively, it is provided "as is" without
any warranties. You use it at your own discretion. The author is not responsible
for any data loss, system issues, or other damages that may occur from using
this software.

